---
name: changelog-categories
version: 1.0.0
description: >-
  Feature-request repro: a Keep a Changelog entry grouped by category, where
  each category owns its own list of change items (summary + optional PR
  link). This is the natural shape for the data (categories[].items[]) but
  currently fails var-file loading with ERR_VAL_NESTED_ARRAY_UNSUPPORTED
  ("arrays of objects are not supported at nested paths"), because `items`
  is an array of objects nested inside `categories`, which is itself an
  array of objects.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - version
  - date
  - categories
metadata:
  purpose: >-
    Demonstrate desired support for an array-of-objects field nested inside
    another array-of-objects (categories[].items[]). See sibling example
    jagged-array-values.md.j2 for the narrower plain-array case.
---
## [{{ version }}] - {{ date }}
{% for category in categories %}

### {{ category.name }}

{% for item in category.items %}
- {{ item.summary }}{% if item.pr %} (#{{ item.pr }}){% endif +%}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
